# table of LAME (Sources/CLame) that each encoder fills at its init with the same values, so two
# encoders at the same time give a race report with no wrong value. Add no symbol of Dirigible code
# here: a suppression hides a real race.
race:hogege
race:pow43
race:adj43
race:ipow20
